# W2's first E2 batch: every point that does not depend on another arm's result, in groups that share an engine,
# so that the box restarts once per group. About 12 minutes a point (AIPerf builds its dataset for 4), 4 hours in all.
#   benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh benchmarks/e2/w2.campaign

